WEBVTT

00:23:29.243 --> 00:23:31.013
And then of course, on top of that,

00:23:31.037 --> 00:23:33.656
you've got to add what
are going to be the severe cases

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:35.950
and people are going to require
hospitalization.

00:23:35.974 --> 00:23:38.853
And those risks get very large
in the older groups indeed.

00:23:41.193 --> 00:23:43.296
CA: Adam, put these numbers
together for us.

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:44.470
In your models,

00:23:44.494 --> 00:23:49.407
if you put together
a reproduction rate of two to three

00:23:49.431 --> 00:23:53.548
and a fatality rate
of 0.5 percent to one percent

00:23:53.572 --> 00:23:56.062
and you run the simulation,

00:23:56.086 --> 00:23:57.620
what does it look like?

00:23:58.699 --> 00:24:01.517
AK: So if you have
this uncontrolled transmission,